
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#10152f">
<meta name="description" content="MindSpark Kids - Discover, learn, play and grow through interactive education, memory challenges and family learning.">
<title>MindSpark Kids | Learning Without Limits</title>

<style>
:root {
  --navy:#10152f;
  --blue:#5267ed;
  --purple:#8055ed;
  --cyan:#36c6df;
  --yellow:#ffd35c;
  --pink:#ff79ae;
  --green:#48c99b;
  --bg:#f5f6fc;
  --white:#ffffff;
  --text:#242b46;
  --muted:#788098;
  --radius:22px;
  --shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(30,40,90,.09);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  line-height:1.6;
}
button,a{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.container{width:min(1180px,92%);margin:auto}
.section{padding:85px 0}
.section-title{text-align:center;margin-bottom:42px}
.section-title h2{font-size:clamp(29px,4vw,43px);line-height:1.2}
.section-title p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
.gradient{
  background:linear-gradient(110deg,var(--blue),var(--purple));
  -webkit-background-clip:text;
  background-clip:text;
  color:transparent;
}
.btn{
  border:0;border-radius:13px;padding:13px 22px;
  font-weight:800;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;gap:8px;transition:.2s;
}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--blue);color:white}
.btn-light{background:white;color:var(--navy)}
.btn-dark{background:var(--navy);color:white}
.btn-outline{border:1px solid #dfe2ee;background:white;color:var(--text)}
header{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);
  backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
  border-bottom:1px solid #eceef5;
}
.nav{
  height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;
}
.logo{font-size:23px;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-1px;color:var(--navy)}
.logo span{color:var(--purple)}
.logo small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--muted)}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--blue)}
.menu-btn{display:none;border:0;background:none;font-size:25px}
.hero{
  overflow:hidden;position:relative;
  background:linear-gradient(130deg,#111834,#292c72 65%,#6546be);
  color:white;padding:90px 0 100px;
}
.hero:before,.hero:after{
  content:"";position:absolute;border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}
.hero:before{width:400px;height:400px;right:-100px;top:-140px}
.hero:after{width:250px;height:250px;left:45%;bottom:-180px}
.hero-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;
  align-items:center;gap:50px;position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.eyebrow{
  display:inline-block;padding:7px 13px;border-radius:50px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:12px;
  font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:20px;
}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,69px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-2px}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--yellow)}
.hero-copy{color:#d8dcfa;font-size:17px;max-width:540px;margin:23px 0 30px}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:30px;margin-top:35px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-stats strong{display:block;font-size:22px}
.hero-stats small{color:#c7cbee}
.hero-art{
  min-height:390px;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;
}
.orbit{
  width:320px;height:320px;border-radius:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#8c70ff,#4ec9ee);
  display:grid;place-items:center;
  box-shadow:0 0 90px rgba(104,112,255,.4);
  font-size:145px;
}
.float-card{
  position:absolute;background:white;color:var(--text);
  padding:15px 18px;border-radius:17px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  font-size:13px;font-weight:800;
}
.float-card.one{top:35px;right:0}
.float-card.two{bottom:35px;left:0}
.float-card.three{right:-5px;bottom:25px}
.trust-strip{
  display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;
  padding:24px;background:white;color:var(--muted);
  font-size:13px;font-weight:800;
}
.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
.feature-card{
  padding:27px;background:white;border-radius:var(--radius);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:.25s;
}
.feature-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px)}
.feature-icon{
  width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:17px;
  display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:17px;
}
.feature-card h3{margin-bottom:8px}
.feature-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.blue{background:#e8edff}.pink{background:#ffedf5}
.yellow{background:#fff4d8}.green{background:#e2f8ee}
.cyan{background:#e2f8fc}.purple{background:#f0e9ff}

.learning-section{background:#fff}
.learning-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:45px;align-items:center;
}
.learning-preview{
  border-radius:25px;padding:27px;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e6eaff,#f6eaff);
}
.video-window{
  min-height:245px;border-radius:19px;
  display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;color:white;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#252e71,#8551d9);
  padding:25px;
}
.play-button{
  width:65px;height:65px;border-radius:50%;
  border:0;background:white;color:var(--blue);
  font-size:24px;margin-bottom:12px;
}
.progress{height:9px;background:#e6e9f3;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden}
.progress span{display:block;height:100%;width:68%;background:var(--green);border-radius:20px}
.learning-info h3{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:15px}
.learning-info p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:22px}
.check-list{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:13px}
.check-list li:before{content:"✓";color:var(--green);font-weight:900;margin-right:10px}

.demo-section{background:#f0f2ff}
.demo-box{
  max-width:740px;margin:auto;background:white;
  border-radius:25px;padding:35px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.demo-question{font-size:23px;font-weight:900;margin:20px 0}
.answers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.answer{
  padding:17px;border:2px solid #e8eaf3;
  background:white;border-radius:13px;text-align:left;font-weight:800;
}
.answer:hover{border-color:var(--blue);background:#f3f4ff}
.answer.correct{background:#e5f9ed;border-color:var(--green)}
.answer.wrong{background:#ffeded;border-color:#ef8585}
.feedback{margin-top:18px;font-weight:800;min-height:28px}

.parent-section{background:var(--navy);color:white}
.parent-section .section-title p{color:#b8bfdf}
.parent-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px}
.parent-card{
  background:#20294d;border:1px solid #39446d;
  border-radius:22px;padding:25px;
}
.parent-card h3{margin-bottom:17px}
.metric{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #3b466d;
}
.metric:last-child{border:0}
.metric strong{font-size:20px;color:var(--yellow)}
.parent-message{
  padding:15px;background:#303b65;border-radius:13px;margin-top:12px;
}
.parent-message small{color:#c2c9e6}

.age-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.age-card{
  border-radius:22px;padding:27px;text-align:center;
  background:white;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.age-card .age-icon{font-size:55px;margin-bottom:10px}
.age-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:10px}

.pricing-section{background:#fff}
.pricing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;align-items:stretch}
.price-card{
  padding:24px;border:1px solid #e7e9f2;border-radius:22px;
  position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
}
.price-card.popular{
  border:2px solid var(--blue);box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.popular-tag{
  position:absolute;top:-13px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  background:var(--blue);color:white;padding:5px 13px;
  font-size:10px;font-weight:900;border-radius:50px;white-space:nowrap;
}
.price{font-size:38px;font-weight:950;margin:15px 0}
.price small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
.price-card ul{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:11px;margin:20px 0;flex:1}
.price-card li{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.price-card li:before{content:"✓";color:var(--green);font-weight:900;margin-right:8px}
.price-card .btn{width:100%;margin-top:15px}

.ad-section{
  background:linear-gradient(130deg,#e8ebff,#f5eaff);
}
.ad-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:35px;align-items:center}
.ad-card{
  background:white;padding:28px;border-radius:22px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.ad-item{
  padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f5;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;
}
.ad-item:last-child{border:0}
.ad-item span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.ad-item strong{white-space:nowrap}
.ad-price{font-size:25px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:950}

.cta{
  background:linear-gradient(120deg,#5969ec,#8953d7);
  color:white;text-align:center;border-radius:28px;padding:60px 25px;
}
.cta h2{font-size:clamp(29px,4vw,43px)}
.cta p{color:#e0e3ff;margin:15px auto 25px;max-width:600px}

footer{background:#0c1128;color:white;padding:55px 0 25px}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px}
footer p,footer a{color:#b6bdd8;font-size:13px}
footer h4{margin-bottom:15px}
.footer-links{display:grid;gap:10px}
.footer-bottom{
  border-top:1px solid #2c3454;margin-top:35px;padding-top:20px;
  color:#9ca6ca;font-size:12px;display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.modal{
  display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:#090e28c9;
  z-index:200;place-items:center;padding:20px;
}
.modal.active{display:grid}
.modal-content{
  background:white;border-radius:22px;padding:30px;
  max-width:430px;width:100%;position:relative;
}
.modal-content input,.modal-content select{
  width:100%;padding:13px;border:1px solid #dfe2ee;
  border-radius:10px;margin:9px 0 15px;
}
.close{
  position:absolute;right:18px;top:12px;
  background:none;border:0;font-size:25px;
}
#toast{
  position:fixed;bottom:25px;right:25px;
  background:var(--navy);color:white;padding:15px 20px;
  border-radius:13px;display:none;z-index:300;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);max-width:320px;
}

@media(max-width:950px){
  .pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .hero-grid{gap:20px}
  .feature-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media(max-width:700px){
  .nav-links{
    display:none;position:absolute;top:76px;left:0;width:100%;
    padding:25px;background:white;flex-direction:column;
    align-items:stretch;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .nav-links.open{display:flex}
  .menu-btn{display:block}
  .hero{padding:65px 0}
  .hero-grid,.learning-grid,.parent-grid,.ad-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero-art{min-height:300px}
  .orbit{width:235px;height:235px;font-size:100px}
  .float-card.one{right:0}
  .feature-grid,.age-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .answers{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .demo-box{padding:23px}
  .section{padding:60px 0}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="container nav">
    <a class="logo" href="#">MIND<span>SPARK</span> KIDS
      <small>LEARN • PLAY • GROW</small>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#learning">Learning</a>
      <a href="#parents">Parents</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#partners">Advertisers</a>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openModal('signup')">Join the Adventure</button>
    </nav>
    <button class="menu-btn" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Toggle navigation">☰</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">🚀 THE FUTURE OF FUN LEARNING</span>
      <h1>Big Dreams.<br>Bright Minds.<br><span>Unlimited Discovery.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">
        Turn learning into an adventure. Discover interactive lessons,
        memory challenges, educational games and family-powered growth.
        Every little discovery builds a brighter future.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-light" onclick="openModal('signup')">Start Learning Free →</button>
        <a href="#learning" class="btn btn-outline" style="color:white;background:transparent;border-color:#ffffff66">Explore Learning</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div><strong>35 sec</strong><small>Quick lessons</small></div>
        <div><strong>3 levels</strong><small>Age-based learning</small></div>
        <div><strong>∞</strong><small>Ways to discover</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art">
      <div class="orbit">🧠</div>
      <div class="float-card one">⭐ Earn learning rewards</div>
      <div class="float-card two">🎮 Play. Think. Discover.</div>
      <div class="float-card three">🏆 Level up!</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="trust-strip">
  <span>🧠 MEMORY DEVELOPMENT</span>
  <span>🎮 INTERACTIVE PLAY</span>
  <span>👨‍👩‍👧 FAMILY LEARNING</span>
  <span>📚 SMARTER STUDYING</span>
</div>

<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>More Than Learning. <span class="gradient">A Whole New World.</span></h2>
      <p>Powerful learning experiences designed to make discovery exciting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon blue">🧠</div>
        <h3>Memory Missions</h3>
        <p>Practice recall, visual memory, listening, sequencing and problem-solving through interactive challenges.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon pink">🎬</div>
        <h3>35-Second Learning</h3>
        <p>Quick animated lessons that introduce ideas and encourage children to remember what they learned.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon yellow">🏆</div>
        <h3>Achievement Universe</h3>
        <p>Unlock rewards, collect badges, complete missions and explore new educational worlds.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon green">👨‍👩‍👧</div>
        <h3>Parent + Child</h3>
        <p>Private family communication, progress reports and activities designed to learn together.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon cyan">📰</div>
        <h3>Discovery Board</h3>
        <p>Age-appropriate discoveries, science facts, vocabulary, positive stories and moderated announcements.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon purple">📊</div>
        <h3>Smart Testing</h3>
        <p>Adaptive quizzes, learning assessments and spaced repetition to encourage long-term retention.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section learning-section" id="learning">
  <div class="container learning-grid">
    <div class="learning-preview">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:800">
        <span>🎬 Today's Brain Boost</span><span style="color:var(--blue)">35 SEC</span>
      </div>
      <div class="video-window">
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:55px">🪐</div>
          <h3>Journey Through Space</h3>
          <p style="color:#d9dcff">Discover something amazing about our solar system!</p>
          <button class="play-button" onclick="startLesson()">▶</button>
          <p id="lessonStatus" style="font-size:12px">Tap to start your lesson</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800">
        <span>Learning progress</span><span>68%</span>
      </div>
      <div class="progress"><span></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="learning-info">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="background:#e9ebff;color:var(--blue)">LEARNING THAT STICKS</span>
      <h3>Small lessons.<br><span class="gradient">Big breakthroughs.</span></h3>
      <p>Every lesson is an opportunity to learn, remember, practice and apply a new skill.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Short educational video experiences</li>
        <li>Interactive questions after every lesson</li>
        <li>Memory reinforcement activities</li>
        <li>Learning paths that adapt to progress</li>
        <li>Encouraging rewards and achievements</li>
      </ul>
      <br>
      <a href="#demo" class="btn btn-primary">Try a Learning Challenge →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section demo-section" id="demo">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Let's Test That <span class="gradient">Bright Brain!</span></h2>
      <p>Try a sample memory and knowledge challenge.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-box">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="background:#e8edff;color:var(--blue)">🚀 SPACE EXPLORER CHALLENGE</span>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:18px">
        <strong>Question 1 of 3</strong><strong id="score">⭐ 0 points</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="progress" style="margin-top:10px"><span id="quizProgress" style="width:33%"></span></div>
      <div class="demo-question" id="question">Which planet is known as the Red Planet?</div>
      <div class="answers" id="answers">
        <button class="answer" onclick="checkAnswer(0)">🌍 Earth</button>
        <button class="answer" onclick="checkAnswer(1)">🔴 Mars</button>
        <button class="answer" onclick="checkAnswer(2)">🪐 Saturn</button>
        <button class="answer" onclick="checkAnswer(3)">🌞 Sun</button>
      </div>
      <div class="feedback" id="feedback" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <button id="nextQuestion" class="btn btn-primary" style="display:none;margin-top:15px" onclick="nextQuestion()">Next Challenge →</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section parent-section" id="parents">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Parents Are Part of the Adventure.</h2>
      <p>Make every learning milestone something the whole family can celebrate.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="parent-grid">
      <div class="parent-card">
        <h3>📊 Family Learning Snapshot</h3>
        <div class="metric"><span>Weekly learning sessions</span><strong>12</strong></div>
        <div class="metric"><span>Practice challenges</span><strong>24</strong></div>
        <div class="metric"><span>Learning achievements</span><strong>8</strong></div>
        <div class="metric"><span>Current learning streak</span><strong>5 days</strong></div>
        <p style="color:#b8c1e0;font-size:11px;margin-top:12px">Illustrative dashboard data, not a real child assessment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="parent-card">
        <h3>💌 Family Message Board</h3>
        <div class="parent-message">
          <strong>🌟 Today's encouragement</strong>
          <p>You did an amazing job exploring science today!</p>
          <small>Sample family message</small>
        </div>
        <div class="parent-message">
          <strong>🎯 Tonight's 5-Minute Challenge</strong>
          <p>Ask your child to name three things they learned today.</p>
          <small>Family activity</small>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-light" style="margin-top:15px" onclick="showToast('Family messaging will be enabled after secure account integration.')">Explore Family Tools</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>A Learning Journey for <span class="gradient">Every Age.</span></h2>
      <p>Content and challenges designed around developmental stages.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="age-grid">
      <div class="age-card">
        <div class="age-icon">🧸</div>
        <h3>Little Explorers</h3>
        <strong>Ages 4–6</strong>
        <p>Letters, colors, sounds, counting, recognition and listening activities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="age-card">
        <div class="age-icon">🚀</div>
        <h3>Bright Discoverers</h3>
        <strong>Ages 7–10</strong>
        <p>Reading, math, science, memory challenges and comprehension.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="age-card">
        <div class="age-icon">🌌</div>
        <h3>Future Innovators</h3>
        <strong>Ages 11–15</strong>
        <p>Critical thinking, financial literacy, advanced learning and test preparation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pricing-section" id="pricing">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Big Opportunities. <span class="gradient">Affordable Learning.</span></h2>
      <p>Choose the learning experience that fits your family.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-grid">
      <article class="price-card">
        <h3>Explorer</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">A free place to begin.</p>
        <div class="price">$0<small>/month</small></div>
        <ul>
          <li>Basic learning activities</li>
          <li>Limited daily lessons</li>
          <li>Memory games</li>
          <li>One child profile</li>
          <li>Basic progress view</li>
        </ul>
